# Full-resolution originals pulled from the client's GoHighLevel CDN — 51 files,
# ~245MB, mostly 5712x4284. Every image the site actually serves has already
# been resized into public/img/ (~11MB total), which IS tracked.
#
# Kept on disk rather than deleted: assets.cdn.filesafe.space is the client's old
# platform and disappears the day they leave it, so this is the only full-res
# archive of their job photography. Ignored rather than committed because 245MB
# of source images does not belong in the repo — every other site's raw/ folder
# is a JSON archive under 200KB.
#
# If this working copy is ever cleaned, re-download from raw/all-media.txt.
